WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,280
The foot of the mountain is remote and there is no competition. It is also convenient for hunting.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:10,270
But there is a lot of competition for medicine in the homestead. I have just stopped the invasion, and the Qin family may also obstruct it.

3
00:00:10,270 --> 00:00:16,410
I need to clean up the cave first and let the villagers know that I really want to live a good life.

4
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:54,900
It's a little cold, but it still looks like a bed

5
00:00:54,900 --> 00:01:00,350
Need to make a door
